          "scope": "Direct inventory bandaging of the exact local self body in SP/Host, root favorite bandages. Repeat means two pending uses of the same selected object with a same-type spare preserved; supply replacement has a distinct new ID. No reused-ID, network replay, independent-wound or bag-return coverage implied.",
